  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1411.02 Operator Conduct",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1411.02 Operator Conduct. All persons operating or otherwise using a challenge course or zip line shall conduct themselves in a manner which will not endanger:\n\n(a) Any other person operating, riding on, or otherwise using said challenge course or zip line, or any other challenge course or zip line;\n\n(b) Themselves;\n\n(c) Any employee of the owner or operator of the challenge course or zip line; or\n\n(d) The challenge course or zip line.\n\nSource. #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1400.html"
